model.Destinations.push( {"Categories":[9],"HiddenTopics":[],"Topics":[4],"Id":75,"TextResource":{"Name":"modulo-de-informacion-np","Translations":[{"Text":"Módulo de información NP","Abbreviation":""},{"Text":"Módulo de información NP","Abbreviation":""}]},"ShapeIndexes":{"ActualShapeList":[{"FloorId":"3","Id":16},{"FloorId":"3","Id":28},{"FloorId":"1","Id":220}]},"Description":{"Name":"description","Translations":[{"Text":"<p>Porque nuestra misión es hacer que su estadía en el terminal sea placentera y entregar soluciones ante cada una de las dudas o problemas que pueda tener en su visita, en los mesones de información siempre encontrará a alguien dispuesto a brindarle ayuda en cualquier momento del día.<\/p>\n","Abbreviation":""},{"Text":"<p>Because our mission is to make your experience at the terminal enjoyable and solve any doubts or problems you may have during your visit, our information desk staff are always ready to help you at any hour of the day.<\/p>\n","Abbreviation":""}]},"Created":"1488916780","Updated":"1488916780","Picture":{"Url":"http:\/\/front-airport-pudahuel.viadirect.com\/sites\/default\/files\/075_modulo-de-informacion-np.png"},"Url":{"Name":"Url","Translations":{"1":{"Text":"http:\/\/front-airport-pudahuel.viadirect.com\/en\/passangers-information\/m%C3%B3dulo-de-informaci%C3%B3n-np","Abbreviation":""},"0":{"Text":"http:\/\/front-airport-pudahuel.viadirect.com\/es\/informaciones-al-pasajero\/m%C3%B3dulo-de-informaci%C3%B3n-np","Abbreviation":""}}},"LogoMap":{"Translations":{"1":{"Url":"http:\/\/front-airport-pudahuel.viadirect.com\/sites\/default\/files\/viadirect\/logos\/map\/0\/075_modulo-de-informacion-np.png","LocalUrl":"Destinations\/75\/MapLogo_1.png"},"0":{"Url":"http:\/\/front-airport-pudahuel.viadirect.com\/sites\/default\/files\/viadirect\/logos\/map\/0\/075_modulo-de-informacion-np.png","LocalUrl":"Destinations\/75\/MapLogo_0.png"}}},"ExternalDatas":{"Data":[]},"HasAdditionalInfo":false});

model.Destinations.push( {"Categories":[9],"HiddenTopics":[26],"Topics":[42],"Id":76,"TextResource":{"Name":"movistar","Translations":[{"Text":"Movistar","Abbreviation":""},{"Text":"Movistar","Abbreviation":""}]},"ShapeIndexes":{"ActualShapeList":[{"FloorId":"3","Id":13}]},"Description":{"Name":"description","Translations":[{"Text":"<p>Telefónica es una de las mayores compañías de telecomunicaciones del mundo por capitalización bursátil y número de clientes, presente en 21 países. En su local de Aeropuerto, Movistar provee servicios de roaming internacional  para pasajeros chilenos que viajan al exterior.<\/p>\n","Abbreviation":""},{"Text":"<p>Telefonica is one of the major telecommunications companies worldwide, both for stock market investment and client portfolio. Present in 21 countries. With a spot at the International Santiago Airport, Movistar provides international roaming service for Chilean customers who travel abroad.<\/p>\n","Abbreviation":""}]},"Created":"1488916780","Updated":"1488916780","Picture":{"Url":"http:\/\/front-airport-pudahuel.viadirect.com\/sites\/default\/files\/076_movistar.png"},"Url":{"Name":"Url","Translations":{"1":{"Text":"http:\/\/front-airport-pudahuel.viadirect.com\/en\/telephones\/movistar","Abbreviation":""},"0":{"Text":"http:\/\/front-airport-pudahuel.viadirect.com\/es\/telefonia\/movistar","Abbreviation":""}}},"LogoMap":{"Translations":{"1":{"Url":"http:\/\/front-airport-pudahuel.viadirect.com\/sites\/default\/files\/viadirect\/logos\/map\/0\/076_movistar.png","LocalUrl":"Destinations\/76\/MapLogo_1.png"},"0":{"Url":"http:\/\/front-airport-pudahuel.viadirect.com\/sites\/default\/files\/viadirect\/logos\/map\/0\/076_movistar.png","LocalUrl":"Destinations\/76\/MapLogo_0.png"}}},"ExternalDatas":{"Data":[]},"HasAdditionalInfo":false});

model.Destinations.push( {"Categories":[10],"HiddenTopics":[24],"Topics":[1],"Id":77,"TextResource":{"Name":"mow","Translations":[{"Text":"MOW","Abbreviation":""},{"Text":"MOW","Abbreviation":""}]},"ShapeIndexes":{"ActualShapeList":[{"FloorId":"3","Id":95}]},"Description":{"Name":"description","Translations":[{"Text":"<p>Proteja su Smartphone, iPhone, Tablet o iPad y dele un nuevo estilo e imagen con los cases y skins que Gizmobies tiene para usted. Diseños creativos y novedosos se combinan con otros más tradicionales y elegantes, entregándole opciones para todos los gustos. <\/p>\n","Abbreviation":""},{"Text":"<p>Protect your smartphone, iPhone, tablet or iPad and give it a new style and image with the cases and skins that Gizmobies has for you. Creative and novel designs are combined with other more traditional and elegant ones to provide options for all tastes.<\/p>\n","Abbreviation":""}]},"Created":"1488916780","Updated":"1488916780","Url":{"Name":"Url","Translations":{"1":{"Text":"http:\/\/front-airport-pudahuel.viadirect.com\/en\/accesories\/mow","Abbreviation":""},"0":{"Text":"http:\/\/front-airport-pudahuel.viadirect.com\/es\/accesorios\/mow","Abbreviation":""}}},"LogoMap":{"Translations":{"1":{"Url":"http:\/\/front-airport-pudahuel.viadirect.com\/sites\/default\/files\/viadirect\/logos\/map\/0\/077_mow.png","LocalUrl":"Destinations\/77\/MapLogo_1.png"},"0":{"Url":"http:\/\/front-airport-pudahuel.viadirect.com\/sites\/default\/files\/viadirect\/logos\/map\/0\/077_mow.png","LocalUrl":"Destinations\/77\/MapLogo_0.png"}}},"ExternalDatas":{"Data":[{"key":"field_phone","label":"Phone","field_name":"field_shop_phone"},{"key":"field_shop_site_internet","label":"Website","field_name":"field_shop_site_internet"},{"key":"field_opening_hours","label":"Opening hours","field_name":"field_shop_openinghours"}]},"HasAdditionalInfo":true});

model.Destinations.push( {"Categories":[10],"HiddenTopics":[26],"Topics":[17],"Id":78,"TextResource":{"Name":"mr-nuts","Translations":[{"Text":"Mr Nuts","Abbreviation":""},{"Text":"Mr Nuts","Abbreviation":""}]},"ShapeIndexes":{"ActualShapeList":[{"FloorId":"1","Id":239},{"FloorId":"3","Id":296}]},"Description":{"Name":"description","Translations":[{"Text":"<p>El maní confitado que nació en Chile y se tomó gran parte del mundo también está presente en el aeropuerto, ahora con más opciones de frutos secos para disfrutar en cualquier momento de uno de los sabores tradicionales de Chile.<\/p>\n","Abbreviation":""},{"Text":"<p>The candied peanuts recipe which originated in Chile and spread to a large part of the world is also available at the airport, now with more dried fruit options so that you can enjoy one of Chile's traditional flavors at any time.<\/p>\n","Abbreviation":""}]},"Created":"1488916780","Updated":"1488916780","Picture":{"Url":"http:\/\/front-airport-pudahuel.viadirect.com\/sites\/default\/files\/078_mr-nuts.png"},"Url":{"Name":"Url","Translations":{"1":{"Text":"http:\/\/front-airport-pudahuel.viadirect.com\/en\/delicatessen\/mr-nuts","Abbreviation":""},"0":{"Text":"http:\/\/front-airport-pudahuel.viadirect.com\/es\/delicatessen\/mr-nuts","Abbreviation":""}}},"LogoMap":{"Translations":{"1":{"Url":"http:\/\/front-airport-pudahuel.viadirect.com\/sites\/default\/files\/viadirect\/logos\/map\/0\/078_mr-nuts.png","LocalUrl":"Destinations\/78\/MapLogo_1.png"},"0":{"Url":"http:\/\/front-airport-pudahuel.viadirect.com\/sites\/default\/files\/viadirect\/logos\/map\/0\/078_mr-nuts.png","LocalUrl":"Destinations\/78\/MapLogo_0.png"}}},"ExternalDatas":{"Data":[{"key":"field_phone","label":"Phone","field_name":"field_shop_phone"},{"key":"field_shop_site_internet","label":"Website","field_name":"field_shop_site_internet"},{"key":"field_opening_hours","label":"Opening hours","field_name":"field_shop_openinghours"}]},"HasAdditionalInfo":true});

