model.Destinations.push( {"Categories":[10],"HiddenTopics":[24],"Topics":[12],"Id":112,"TextResource":{"Name":"sol-y-mar","Translations":[{"Text":"Sol y Mar","Abbreviation":""},{"Text":"Sol y Mar","Abbreviation":""}]},"ShapeIndexes":{"ActualShapeList":[{"FloorId":"3","Id":107}]},"Description":{"Name":"description","Translations":[{"Text":"<p>Accesorios, adornos, carteras y souvenirs novedosos confeccionados a mano por artesanos calificados, utilizando materiales tradicionales del país para conseguir un recuerdo perfecto que captura la esencia y tradición de Chile.<\/p>\n","Abbreviation":""},{"Text":"<p>Find innovative accessories, ornaments, handbags and souvenirs, handmade by skilled craftsmen using traditional local materials to achieve a perfect memento that captures the essence and tradition of Chile.<\/p>\n","Abbreviation":""}]},"Created":"1488916788","Updated":"1488916788","Picture":{"Url":"http:\/\/front-airport-pudahuel.viadirect.com\/sites\/default\/files\/112_sol-y-mar.png"},"Url":{"Name":"Url","Translations":{"1":{"Text":"http:\/\/front-airport-pudahuel.viadirect.com\/en\/arthesany-souvenirs\/sol-y-mar","Abbreviation":""},"0":{"Text":"http:\/\/front-airport-pudahuel.viadirect.com\/es\/artesanias-y-souvenirs\/sol-y-mar","Abbreviation":""}}},"LogoMap":{"Translations":{"1":{"Url":"http:\/\/front-airport-pudahuel.viadirect.com\/sites\/default\/files\/viadirect\/logos\/map\/0\/112_sol-y-mar.png","LocalUrl":"Destinations\/112\/MapLogo_1.png"},"0":{"Url":"http:\/\/front-airport-pudahuel.viadirect.com\/sites\/default\/files\/viadirect\/logos\/map\/0\/112_sol-y-mar.png","LocalUrl":"Destinations\/112\/MapLogo_0.png"}}},"ExternalDatas":{"Data":[{"key":"field_phone","label":"Phone","field_name":"field_shop_phone"},{"key":"field_shop_site_internet","label":"Website","field_name":"field_shop_site_internet"},{"key":"field_opening_hours","label":"Opening hours","field_name":"field_shop_openinghours"}]},"HasAdditionalInfo":true});

model.Destinations.push( {"Categories":[10],"HiddenTopics":[26],"Topics":[],"Id":113,"TextResource":{"Name":"solini","Translations":[{"Text":"Solini","Abbreviation":""},{"Text":"Solini","Abbreviation":""}]},"ShapeIndexes":{"ActualShapeList":[{"FloorId":"3","Id":40}]},"Description":{"Name":"description","Translations":[{"Text":"<p>Para ver y verse mejor, además de proteger sus ojos del sol, lo ideal es tener lentes con estilo y de gran calidad, los que puede encontrar entre la gran variedad de diseños y marcas que Top Sol ofrece en cada una de sus tiendas en el aeropuerto.<\/p>\n","Abbreviation":""},{"Text":"<p>To look and see better, it’s not enough to protect your eyes from the sun; the ideal is to wear top quality style sunglasses, such as the large variety of designs and brands that Top Sol offers you in each of its airport shops.<\/p>\n","Abbreviation":""}]},"Created":"1488916788","Updated":"1488916788","Picture":{"Url":"http:\/\/front-airport-pudahuel.viadirect.com\/sites\/default\/files\/113_solini.png"},"Url":{"Name":"Url","Translations":[]},"LogoMap":{"Translations":{"1":{"Url":"http:\/\/front-airport-pudahuel.viadirect.com\/sites\/default\/files\/viadirect\/logos\/map\/0\/113_solini.png","LocalUrl":"Destinations\/113\/MapLogo_1.png"},"0":{"Url":"http:\/\/front-airport-pudahuel.viadirect.com\/sites\/default\/files\/viadirect\/logos\/map\/0\/113_solini.png","LocalUrl":"Destinations\/113\/MapLogo_0.png"}}},"ExternalDatas":{"Data":[{"key":"field_phone","label":"Phone","field_name":"field_shop_phone"},{"key":"field_shop_site_internet","label":"Website","field_name":"field_shop_site_internet"},{"key":"field_opening_hours","label":"Opening hours","field_name":"field_shop_openinghours"}]},"HasAdditionalInfo":true});

model.Destinations.push( {"Categories":[8],"HiddenTopics":[],"Topics":[13],"Id":114,"TextResource":{"Name":"starbucks","Translations":[{"Text":"Starbucks","Abbreviation":""},{"Text":"Starbucks","Abbreviation":""}]},"ShapeIndexes":{"ActualShapeList":[{"FloorId":"3","Id":63},{"FloorId":"3","Id":72},{"FloorId":"3","Id":74},{"FloorId":"3","Id":132},{"FloorId":"2","Id":161}]},"Description":{"Name":"description","Translations":[{"Text":"<p>La leyenda que llevó al café a todos los rincones del mundo, buscando la mejor calidad en cada una de sus variedades para que cada taza entregue una experiencia distinta, desde la siembra del grano hasta la preparación misma.<\/p>\n","Abbreviation":""},{"Text":"<p>The legend that took coffee to all corners of the world, seeking out the best quality in each variety to offer a different experience with every cup, from the time coffee beans are sewn to the time they are brewed.<\/p>\n","Abbreviation":""}]},"Created":"1488916788","Updated":"1488916788","Picture":{"Url":"http:\/\/front-airport-pudahuel.viadirect.com\/sites\/default\/files\/114_starbucks.png"},"Url":{"Name":"Url","Translations":{"1":{"Text":"http:\/\/front-airport-pudahuel.viadirect.com\/en\/cafeterias\/starbucks","Abbreviation":""},"0":{"Text":"http:\/\/front-airport-pudahuel.viadirect.com\/es\/cafeterias\/starbucks","Abbreviation":""}}},"LogoMap":{"Translations":{"1":{"Url":"http:\/\/front-airport-pudahuel.viadirect.com\/sites\/default\/files\/viadirect\/logos\/map\/0\/114_starbucks.png","LocalUrl":"Destinations\/114\/MapLogo_1.png"},"0":{"Url":"http:\/\/front-airport-pudahuel.viadirect.com\/sites\/default\/files\/viadirect\/logos\/map\/0\/114_starbucks.png","LocalUrl":"Destinations\/114\/MapLogo_0.png"}}},"ExternalDatas":{"Data":[]},"HasAdditionalInfo":false});

